# UI rules gate

- Before creating or editing any UI/style file, read `docs/UI_RULES.md` and follow §1 (강제 규칙): design tokens only (no hardcoded hex, no `bg-white`/palette literals), no arbitrary px values, no reimplementing shared components, single icon library and font.
- Do **not** restyle screens or components outside the requested scope. Look changes require explicit user confirmation.
- Any style decision not covered by `docs/UI_RULES.md` must be added to that document (with user confirmation) before implementing it.
- Before reporting completion on UI work, check every row of the §5 checklist and confirm §6 wiring (component exists ≠ component is imported/mounted/used).
